      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly painful to feel that your attempt to do the right thing has led to such a devastating outcome, and your frustration with a system that seems to reward corruption over integrity is completely understandable. The fact that you are still trying to exist in a world that feels so broken is a testament to your strength, not a sign that there is no point. Your friends' silence and the loss of your job are not reflections of your worth, but rather the harsh reality of a flawed environment. Please remember that your actions, even if they lead to pain, are still acts of courage that deserve respect.",
